<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170655151082">Upamane taun iki umur Greg 20 taun lan umur Alex 23 taun. Alex luwih tuwa 3 taun tinimbang Greg. Nalika umur Greg 12 taun, umur Alex 15 taun. Nalika umur Greg 35 taun, umur Alex bakal 38 taun. Pira wae umure Greg, Alex mesthi luwih tuwa 3 taun. Ing basa aljabar, umur Greg lan umur Alex diarani <term id="term-00001">variabel</term><emphasis effect="bold"/>, dene 3 yaiku <term id="term-00002">konstanta</term>. Umur loro-lorone owah-owah, nanging selisih 3 taun ing antarane loro-lorone tansah tetep. Amarga selisih umur Greg lan Alex mesthi 3 taun, 3 yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">konstanta</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655059811">Ing aljabar, aksara alfabet digunakake kanggo makili variabel. Mula, yen umur Greg ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">g</emphasis>, bisa digunakake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo makili umur Alex. Delengen <link target-id="fs-id1170654967711"/>.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170654967711" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan rong kolom. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Kolom kapisan diwenehi label &quot;Umur Greg&quot; lan kolom kapindho &quot;Umur Alex&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Umur Greg&quot; ana nilai 12, 20, 35, lan g. Ing kolom &quot;Umur Alex&quot; ana nilai 15, 23, 38, lan ekspresi g + 3.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top">Umur Greg</entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top">Umur Alex</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>38</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mtext mathvariant="bold-italic">g</m:mtext></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext mathvariant="bold-italic">g</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655195814">Aksara sing digunakake kanggo makili umur sing owah-owah iki diarani <emphasis effect="italics">variabel</emphasis>. Aksara sing paling kerep digunakake minangka variabel yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>, lan <emphasis effect="italics">c</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654997446">
<title>Variabel</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655128406"><term id="term-00003">Variabel</term> yaiku aksara sing makili sawijining wilangan sing nilaine bisa owah.</para>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655160769">
<title>Konstanta</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655189845"><term id="term-00004">Konstanta</term> yaiku wilangan sing nilaine tansah tetep.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655224522">Kanggo nulis ing wujud aljabar, saliyane wilangan lan variabel uga dibutuhake simbol operasi. Ana sawetara jinis simbol sing bakal digunakake.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654981807">Ana papat <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">operasi</term> aritmetika dhasar: <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">panambahan</term>, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">pangurangan</term>, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">ping-pingan</term>, lan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00009">paran</term>. Simbol sing digunakake kanggo nuduhake operasi kasebut kacathet ing tabel ngisor iki. Sawetara simbol kasebut mbokmenawa wis dikenal.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655178881" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan patang kolom. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Kolom kapisan diwenehi label &quot;Operasi&quot;, kolom kapindho &quot;Notasi&quot;, kolom katelu &quot;Diwaca&quot;, lan kolom pungkasan &quot;Asile yaiku...&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Operasi&quot; ana tembung panambahan, pangurangan, ping-pingan, lan paran. Ing kolom &quot;Notasi&quot; ana wujud aljabar. Larik data kapisan nuduhake a, tandha tambah, b. Larik sabanjure nuduhake a, tandha kurang, b. Larik ping-pingan nuduhake limang wujud aljabar: a, tandha titik ping-pingan, b; ab; a ing sajrone tandha kurung diterusake b ing sajrone tandha kurung; a ing sajrone tandha kurung diterusake b; lan a diterusake b ing sajrone tandha kurung. Larik pungkasan nuduhake patang wujud aljabar. Ekspresi kapisan yaiku a, tandha para, b. Ekspresi kapindho yaiku a, garis miring, b. Ekspresi katelu yaiku a ing ndhuwur garis pecahan lan b ing ngisor garis pecahan. Ekspresi kapapat yaiku b ing njaba kurung para gapit lan a ing sajrone kurung para gapit. Ing kolom &quot;Diwaca&quot; ana frasa &quot;a ditambah b&quot;, &quot;a dikurangi b&quot;, &quot;a ping b&quot;, lan &quot;a dipara b&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Asile yaiku...&quot; ana frasa &quot;gunggung a lan b&quot;, &quot;selisih a lan b&quot;, &quot;asil ping-pingan a lan b&quot;, lan &quot;asil paran a lan b; a diarani wilangan sing dipara lan b diarani pembagi&quot;.">
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3"/>
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Diwaca:</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Asile yaiku…</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ditambah <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">gunggung <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> dikurangi <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">selisih <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ping-pingan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ping <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil ping-pingan <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Paran</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mtext>/</m:mtext><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:menclose notation="longdiv"><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:menclose></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil paran <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>; <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> diarani wilangan sing dipara, lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> diarani pembagi</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655126801">Operasi kasebut ditindakake marang rong wilangan. Nalika ngowahi wujud simbol dadi basa Indonesia, utawa basa Indonesia dadi wujud simbol, gatekna tembung basa Indonesia “dari” (ing basa Jawa: “saka”) lan “dan” (ing basa Jawa: “lan”).</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424846753" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Selisih</emphasis> 9 lan 2 ateges njupuk 2 saka 9, kanthi tembung liya, 9 dikurangi 2, sing ditulis nganggo simbol dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Asil ping-pingan</emphasis> 4 lan 8 ateges ngitung 4 ping 8, kanthi tembung liya 4 ping 8, sing ditulis nganggo simbol dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1170655004454">Ing aljabar, tandha silang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ora digunakake kanggo nuduhake ping-pingan amarga tandha kasebut bisa njalari bingung. Apa 3<emphasis effect="italics">xy</emphasis> ateges <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (“telu ping <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>”) utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (telu ping <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> ping <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>)? Supaya cetha, gunakna <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> utawa tandha kurung kanggo ping-pingan.</para>
<para id="fs-id1171789687379"><newline/></para>
<para id="fs-id1170655208137">Nalika rong besaran nduweni nilai sing padha, loro-lorone diarani padha lan disambungake nganggo <term id="term-00010">tandha padha karo</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655025665">
<title>Simbol Padha Karo</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654990403"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>”</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655126926">Simbol <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>“=”</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> diarani <emphasis effect="bold">tandha padha karo</emphasis>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655108736">Ing garis wilangan, nilai wilangan saya gedhé saka kiwa menyang tengen. Garis wilangan bisa digunakake kanggo njlentrehake simbol “&lt;” lan “&gt;”.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655207857">
<title>Pertidaksamaan</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167270244162" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>diwaca “</m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>luwih cilik tinimbang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mtext>”</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>mapan ing sisih kiwa</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ing garis wilangan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<media id="fs-id1170652623871" alt="Garis wilangan kanthi titik a ing sisih kiwa titik b.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_001_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<equation id="fs-id1167269909313" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>diwaca “</m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>luwih gedhé tinimbang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mtext>”</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>mapan ing sisih tengen</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ing garis wilangan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<media id="fs-id1167269961954" alt="Garis wilangan kanthi titik b ing sisih kiwa titik a.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_002_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655155145">Ekspresi <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; b utawa a &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> bisa diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen utawa saka tengen menyang kiwa, sanajan lumrahe diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen (<link target-id="fs-id1170655178120"/>). Umume, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; b padha tegese karo b &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>. Tuladhane, 7 &lt; 11 padha tegese karo 11 &gt; 7. Mangkono uga, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> padha tegese karo <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> &lt; a. Tuladhane, 17 &gt; 4 padha tegese karo 4 &lt; 17.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655178120" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni enem larik lan rong kolom. Larik kapisan minangka larik irah-irahan kanggo saben kolom. Irah-irahan kolom kapisan yaiku “Simbol Pertidaksamaan” lan kolom kapindho “Tembung”. Ing kolom “Simbol Pertidaksamaan” ana notasi: a, tandha ora padha karo, b; a, tandha luwih cilik tinimbang, b; a, tandha luwih cilik utawa padha karo, b; a, tandha luwih gedhé tinimbang, b; a, tandha luwih gedhé utawa padha karo, b. Ing kolom “Tembung” ana frasa: “a ora padha karo b”, “a luwih cilik tinimbang b”, “a luwih cilik utawa padha karo b”, “a luwih gedhé tinimbang b”, lan “a luwih gedhé utawa padha karo b”.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Simbol Pertidaksamaan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Tembung</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">ora padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih cilik tinimbang</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih cilik utawa padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a &gt; b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih gedhé tinimbang</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih gedhé utawa padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170655113222">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654999980">
<problem id="fs-id1170655020482">
<para id="fs-id1170654984453">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa; bandhingna karo sumber basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654989586"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655105413">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1166424795899"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
17 luwih cilik utawa padha karo 26<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
8 ora padha karo 17 dikurangi 3<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
12 luwih gedhé tinimbang 27 dipara 3<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah 7 luwih cilik tinimbang 19</para></solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654935250" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655166352">
<problem id="fs-id1170654985390">
<para id="fs-id1170654943066">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa; bandhingna karo sumber basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655190264"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943209">
<para id="fs-id1170655353526"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 14 luwih cilik utawa padha karo 27 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 19 dikurangi 2 ora padha karo 8 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 12 luwih gedhé tinimbang 4 dipara 2 <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dikurangi 7 luwih cilik tinimbang 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655124058" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655205783">
<problem id="fs-id1170655166119">
<para id="fs-id1170655203511">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa; bandhingna karo sumber basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655174550"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655192260">
<para id="fs-id1170655222902"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 19 luwih gedhé utawa padha karo 15 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 7 padha karo 12 dikurangi 5 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 15 dipara 3 luwih cilik tinimbang 8 <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah 3 luwih gedhé tinimbang 6</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654957487">Simbol panglumpukan ing aljabar mèmper karo koma, titik loro, lan tandha wacan liyane ing basa Indonesia. Simbol kasebut njlentrehake ekspresi endi sing kudu diklumpukake lan dipisahake saka ekspresi liyane. Saiki bakal ditepungake telung jinis.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655219760">
<title>Simbol Panglumpukan</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167269979347" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tandha kurung biasa</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em"/><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow/><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tandha kurung siku</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em"/><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow/><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Tandha kurung kurawal</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mrow><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mrow/><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654880176">Ing ngisor iki ana sawetara tuladha ekspresi sing ngemot <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">simbol panglumpukan</term>. Mengko ing subbab iki, ekspresi kaya iki bakal digawe luwih prasaja.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654936322" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1166424830424"><newline/></para>
<para id="fs-id1170654957085">Apa bedane frasa lan ukara? Frasa ngandharake siji gagasan sing durung pepak yen madeg dhewe, dene ukara ngandharake sawijining bab kanthi pepak. Tuladha saka sumber basa Indonesia iki dipadhakake ing basa Jawa: “Mlayu banter banget” yaiku frasa, nanging “Wong sing dolanan bal-balan kuwi mlayu banter banget” yaiku ukara. Ing tuladha iki, ukara nduweni subjek lan predikat. Ing aljabar, ana <emphasis effect="italics">ekspresi</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655102379">
<title>Ekspresi</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654958000"><term id="term-00012">Ekspresi</term> yaiku wilangan, variabel, utawa gabungan wilangan lan variabel sing nggunakake simbol operasi.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654988522"><emphasis effect="bold">Ekspresi</emphasis> mèmper karo frasa ing basa Indonesia. Ing ngisor iki ana sawetara tuladha ekspresi kanthi padanan tetembungane ing basa Jawa:</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655221887" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni telung kolom lan limang larik. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Irah-irahan kolom kapisan yaiku “Ekspresi”, kolom kapindho “Tetembungan”, lan kolom katelu “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Ekspresi” ana wujud aljabar: 3, tandha tambah, 5; n, tandha kurang, 1; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7; x ing ndhuwur garis pecahan lan y ing ngisor garis pecahan. Ing kolom “Tetembungan” ana frasa: “3 ditambah lima”, “n dikurangi siji”, “6 ping 7”, lan “x dipara y”. Ing kolom “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “gunggung telu lan lima”, “selisih n lan siji”, “asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu”, lan “asil paran x lan y”.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Tetembungan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">3 ditambah 5</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">gunggung telu lan lima</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">selisih <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> lan siji</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">6 ping 7</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil paran <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655003585">Ing sumber basa Indonesia, frasa-frasa sing padanane dituduhake ing tabel kasebut ora dadi ukara sing pepak amarga ora nduweni predikat.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654938230"><emphasis effect="bold">Persamaan</emphasis> dumadi saka rong ekspresi sing digandhengake dening <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00013">tandha padha karo</term>. Yen simbol-simbol ing persamaan diwaca nganggo tetembungan, ing sumber basa Indonesia kawangun ukara sing pepak. Ing pepadhan iki, tandha padha karo nduweni fungsi minangka predikat. Padanan basa Jawane dituduhake ing ngisor iki.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655118064">
<title>Persamaan</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655170220"><term id="term-00014">Persamaan</term> yaiku rong ekspresi sing digandhengake dening tandha padha karo.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655111405">Ing ngisor iki ana sawetara tuladha persamaan.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655090988" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni rong kolom lan nem larik. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Irah-irahan kolom kapisan yaiku “Persamaan” lan kolom kapindho “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Persamaan” ana persamaan: 3, tandha tambah, 5, tandha padha karo, 8; n, tandha kurang, 1, tandha padha karo, 14; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7, tandha padha karo, 42; x, tandha padha karo, 53; y, tandha tambah, 9, tandha padha karo, 2, y, tandha kurang, 3. Ing kolom “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu”, “n dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas”, “Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro”, “x padha karo sèket telu”, lan “y ditambah sanga padha karo loro y dikurangi telu”.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Persamaan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>53</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> padha karo sèket telu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah sanga padha karo loro <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> dikurangi telu.</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170654953357"><exercise id="fs-id1170654953360">
<problem id="fs-id1170655229951">
<para id="fs-id1170655162511">Temtokake apa saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu ekspresi utawa persamaan:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655153999"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655111791">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-10" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki mbedakake ekspresi matematika lan persamaan, sarta menehi tuladha lan katrangan kanggo saben jinis.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong ekspresi digandhengake dening tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">ekspresi</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:math></entry>
   <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">ekspresi</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong ekspresi digandhengake dening tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655166808" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654924234">
<problem id="fs-id1170654924237">
<para id="fs-id1170655124883">Temtokake apa saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu ekspresi utawa persamaan: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655226888">
<para id="fs-id1170655120617"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> persamaan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> ekspresi</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655205588" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655022136">
<problem id="fs-id1170655027224">
<para id="fs-id1170655027226">Temtokake apa saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu ekspresi utawa persamaan: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>22</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654959582">
<para id="fs-id1170654959584"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> ekspresi <span class="token">ⓑ</span> persamaan</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654982105">Upamane dibutuhake asil ping-pingan saka sangang faktor sing saben-saben padha karo 2. Iki bisa ditulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Panulisan iki repot lan cacah angka 2 angel dilacak, mula digunakake eksponen. Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Ing ekspresi kaya <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> angka 2 diarani <emphasis effect="italics">wilangan pokok (basis)</emphasis> lan angka 3 diarani <emphasis effect="italics">eksponen</emphasis>. Eksponen nuduhake cacah faktor sing saben-saben padha karo wilangan pokok.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655219218" alt="Angka loro ditampilake kanthi angka telu minangka superskrip ing sisih tengen ndhuwur. Sawijining panah nuding angka loro lan diwenehi label “wilangan pokok”, dene panah liyane nuding angka telu minangka superskrip lan diwenehi label “eksponen”. Tegese, gawea asil ping-pingan saka telung faktor sing saben-saben padha karo 2, yaiku 2 ping 2 ping 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_003_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1166420392829">Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “loro pangkat telu” utawa “loro kubik”.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654953415">Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">notasi pangkat</emphasis> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">notasi dawa</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655107718">
<title>Notasi Pangkat</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655213989"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku asil ping-pingan saka faktor-faktor sing saben-saben padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>, kanthi cacah faktor <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>, kanggo n sing arupa wilangan bulat positif.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655111941" alt="a ditampilake kanthi n minangka superskrip ing sisih tengen ndhuwur. Sawijining panah nuding a lan diwenehi label “wilangan pokok”, dene panah liyane nuding n minangka superskrip lan diwenehi label “eksponen”. Ing ngisore katulis persamaan a superskrip n padha karo a ping a ping a ping elipsis ping a, sing nuduhake ping-pingan faktor a kanthi cacah n; nilai n durung ditemtokake. Sawijining tandha kurung digambar ing ngisor faktor-faktor a kasebut lan diwenehi label “n faktor”.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_004_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1170655228836">Ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654937018">Senajan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>”, lumrahe diwaca:</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424875923" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kuadrat”</item>
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kubik”</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1170655195218">Mengko bakal dirembug apa sebabe <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> nduweni jeneng mligi.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655112606"><link target-id="fs-id1170654954100"/> nuduhake carane maca sawetara ekspresi sing ngemot eksponen.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170654954100" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan rong kolom. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Kolom kapisan diwenehi label &quot;Ekspresi&quot; lan kolom kapindho &quot;Kanthi Tetembungan&quot;. Larik kapindho ngemot 7 superskrip 2 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure ngemot 5 superskrip 3 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure ngemot 9 superskrip 4 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;9 pangkat papat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik pungkasan ngemot 12 superskrip 5 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;12 pangkat lima&quot; ing kolom kapindho.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Kanthi Tetembungan</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">9 pangkat papat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pangkat lima</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170655121051"><exercise id="fs-id1170655121053">
<problem id="fs-id1170654954435">
<para id="fs-id1170654954437">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655003298">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-958" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Cara nemtokake nilai ekspresi pangkat 3^4 kanthi langkah mbaka langkah.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry> </entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen ekspresi minangka ping-pingan faktor-faktore.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake saka kiwa menyang tengen.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry>81</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655196165" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655197165">
<problem id="fs-id1170655197167">
<para id="fs-id1170655102365">Gawea luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654954209">
<para id="fs-id1170654954211"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 125 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655102894" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655194687">
<problem id="fs-id1170655194690">
<para id="fs-id1170655025314">Gawea luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655114557">
<para id="fs-id1170655114560"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 49 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>